            {
              "text": "A video appointment is not recorded. Harbor Help cannot open files or look inside your device."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "tu7",
          "translatable": true,
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Keep your details private"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "tu8",
          "translatable": true,
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "We will not ask for your password or bank details. A support person can explain each step before the appointment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "tu9",
          "translatable": true,
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Call the support line if you would like help booking a video appointment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "tu10",
          "translatable": true,
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "The support line can help with booking and joining. It is not an emergency service."
